    <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this short-run intervention was to produce and publish an analytical document on the evolution of democratic values in Bolivia over the past 20 years (1998-2017). The publication was succesfully released on July 5, 2019 and it is available to general public under the name of CULTURA POLITICA DE LA DEMOCRACIA EN BOLIVIA. 20 A&#xd1;OS. See also www.ciudadaniabolivia.org</narrative>
